---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Life" description="Stories from Luca Silveira's life: growing up between cultures, selling boats in Miami, traveling, and finding connection through soccer.">
  <article id="life" class="life">
    <header class="opening">
      <div>
        <h1>Life</h1>
        <h2 class="lead">A few places I've called home</h2>
        <p>I'm Brazilian-American and grew up in Miami. During my early childhood, I lived in France, Switzerland, and a few different cities across the U.S. I've spoken Portuguese, Spanish, and English for as long as I can remember. Being able to communicate with my family in Brazil and Argentina has always been important to me, especially when we're thousands of miles apart.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait"><img src="/images/life/bench.jpg" width="900" height="1200" alt="Luca enjoying a snack on a sunny park bench" fetchpriority="high" /></figure>
    </header>
    <section class="stories" aria-label="Experiences that shaped me">
      <div class="boats story-row">
        <div>
        <h2>It started with a beat-up inflatable boat</h2>
        <p>I've loved the ocean and fishing for as long as I can remember. When I was 14, I saved up enough money from a real estate drone photography business to buy an old 10-foot inflatable boat with a 6 hp air cooled, Chinese motor for $900. I knew next to nothing about engines, so I spent weeks watching YouTube videos and reading online forums to figure out they worked and to service them. Soon after, I started buying, repairing, and reselling outboard motors and boats, eventually working my way up to 20-foot center consoles with 200-horsepower engines. What started as a way to get out on the water turned into a business I ran throughout high school.</p>
        </div>
        <figure><img src="/images/life/first-boat.jpg" width="1400" height="1050" alt="Luca wearing a life jacket aboard his inflatable boat on the water" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="soccer-story">
        <div class="story-row soccer-row">
          <div>
            <h2>Most weekends were for soccer</h2>
            <p>Growing up in a Brazilian family, playing soccer felt pretty much inevitable. By 16, I was taking it pretty seriously, competing in MLS NEXT and high school soccer against some of the best teams in the country. For my last few years of high school, life revolved around late-night practices and weekends traveling to tournaments. At one point, I was driving around 75 miles a day just getting between school, practice, and home. It was a lot of time spent chasing a ball around, but I definitely wouldn't have done it any differently. It built character :)</p>
          </div>
          <figure><img src="/images/life/soccer.jpg" width="1400" height="962" alt="Luca dribbling a soccer ball during a game" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="travel story-row">
        <figure><img src="/images/life/photo-5014.jpg" width="1400" height="1050" alt="Luca taking a group selfie with young soccer players beside a goal" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>A few stamps in the passport</h2>
          <p>Since starting college, I've had the chance to travel quite a bit and have had the privilege of visiting some pretty cool places across 5 continents. Most recently, I went on a solo backpacking trip through Southeast Asia, which was one of the coolest experiences of my life. I arrived in Bangkok with just a one-way ticket, a backpack, and a three-night hostel reservation. I love going somewhere new, trying different foods, meeting locals I otherwise never would've crossed paths with, and figuring things out as I go. Favorite country? Still can't decide. Probably a three-way tie between Thailand, Indonesia, and Vietnam!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="closing story-row" aria-labelledby="stays-heading">
      <figure><img src="/images/life/photo-3301.jpg" width="1400" height="1050" alt="Luca and another person overlooking the Golden Gate Bridge" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
      <div>
        <h2 id="stays-heading">Family and friends along the way</h2>
        <p>As much as I enjoy traveling and trying new things, some of my favorite memories come from spending time with friends and family. This photo was taken during my first summer in San Francisco, which was actually my first time in California altogether. I'd moved there for my 2025 internship at Instawork, and getting to explore a new city with people close to me made that summer even more memorable.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .life { scroll-margin-top: 32px; }
  .life h1, .life h2, .lead { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .life h1 { font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .life .lead { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .life h2:not(.lead) { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .life p:not(.lead) { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: #45413d; }
  .life p + p { margin-top: 16px; }
  .life figure { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .life img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 3px; }
  .opening { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.85fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
  .portrait { max-width: 350px; justify-self: end; }
  .stories { margin-top: 72px; }
  .boats { border-top: 1px solid #d8d2c9; padding-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  .story-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
  .travel { margin-top: 72px; }
  .soccer-row { grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr; gap: 48px; }
  .closing { margin-top: 72px; padding-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #d8d2c9; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .opening, .story-row { gap: 32px; }
    .life h1 { font-size: 48px; }
    .life .lead { font-size: 28px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .opening, .story-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .life h1 { font-size: 44px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .life h2:not(.lead) { font-size: 26px; }
    .portrait { width: 80%; max-width: 300px; justify-self: center; }
    .stories, .travel, .closing { margin-top: 48px; }
    .boats { margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .travel > div { grid-row: 1; }
    .closing { padding-top: 32px; }
    .closing > div { grid-row: 1; }
  }
</style>
